{"id":"otkrovenno","lemma":"откровенно","pos":"adv","rank":2441,"glosses":["frankly, candidly, openly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/03/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Скажи мне откровенно.","en":"Tell me frankly.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null]},{"text":"Она говорит откровенно.","en":"She speaks frankly.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},null]},{"text":"Откровенно говоря, я его ненавижу.","en":"Frankly speaking, I hate him.","words":[null,null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"to hate","l":"ненавидеть"}]},{"text":"Я могу говорить откровенно?","en":"May I speak frankly?","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"},null]},{"text":"Мы говорили вполне откровенно.","en":"We talked quite frankly.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"quite, fully, entirely"},null]}]}